00:05:52.590 --> 00:06:01.100
It’s probably the weirdest movie Marvel
has done so far next to Guardians of the Galaxy.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:05.449
I think it was more of a comedy when Edgar
Wright was working on it and they wanted the

00:06:05.449 --> 00:06:07.250
tone to be more in line with the other marvel
films.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.240
Edgar Wright has a very awesome personal style
to the way his films look and it’s easy

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:14.020
to understand how trying to fit that into
the Marvel system was hard.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:21.060
The new director Peyton Reed, isn’t really
known for doing bigger action films like this.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:25.320
His most recent work has been TV Work like
New Girl.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:31.600
But he also did Upright Citizens Brigade which
I love, Mr Show on HBO and Weird Al Yankovic’s

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:32.600
tv show.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:36.750
So they wouldn’t have hired him to do the
movie if they didn’t want Ant-Man to be

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:37.750
a comedy.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.509
Just think of it as Marvel’s first Comedy.

00:06:40.509 --> 00:06:55.490
Guardians of The Galaxy is a very funny movie,
but I don’t consider it as a comedy.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:59.070
It’s an action movie that’s also very
funny.

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:17.800
I think Ant-Man will feel like a comedy with
a lot of action in it.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:22.900
If you’re confused about where this fits
in with the other movies.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:26.639
Ant Man is now the final movie in Phase 2.

00:07:26.639 --> 00:07:32.430
When they first announced it, it was supposed
to be the first movie in Phase 3.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.210
But I think because they changed their minds
on the direction they wanted to take, they

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:38.889
decided to fit it in more with what’s been
going on between the first Avengers Movie

00:07:38.889 --> 00:07:39.889
and Avengers 2.

00:07:39.889 --> 00:07:45.960
By all accounts, just assume what’s going
on in the movie is going on around the same

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:46.960
time things in Avengers 2 are happening.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:08:05.460
Once they start doing press for 
the movie they’ll explain the timeline better.

